Z||000005||billyboy||03-07-2001||12:41 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by 80's BOY:<BR><B>Advan Racing or Axis Tuning is the name of the rim manufacturer. Not sure about the style. I actually wanted the white ones, but settled for chrome.<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Actually, they're neither.  They are Rota Impact's.  ABC Wheel & Tire has them on sale, 17" wheels with tires (no size specified) for $799.  Unfortunately they don't have a website, however, their phone number is (818) 957-0406.  <P><BR>||||reg||1
